comments.body:
@saravanan-nexthop this should have been handled by pre-test. Our expected model of manual test is that one should run pre-test once and then run individual tests.

A protection is great to have.

There are 2 PRs try to address the same issue. We need to pick one to keep.

@yxieca 
In the PR I published I am handling the TSA -> TSB transition for all of the bgp tests, not solely for the test_bgp_update_timer. The thinking behind this was that TSA mode would be affecting more than just this test since routes will not be advertised.

CC @saravanan-nexthop
